ferent module or a different  set of modules added to the core  we do a number of different combinations  again to ensure that the performance of  the antibodies  um alone matches the performance of the  antibodies in the cocktail of different  uh modules you can see the r values in  the table to the right  the correlation is high our values that  are always greater than 0.9  finally all of those antibodies that  have passed this test  up to this point go through a tma screen  in the tma screen we use tissue  microarray arrays to look at the  differential expression  across different tissues and including  cancer  and non-cancer tissues and ensure that  our antibodies  in these core and module setups are  going to work in real world samples  so as we've discussed our geomix dsp  portfolio  of pre-validated content in both i o and  neuroscience  includes over 200 different antibodies  all of these antibodies go through a  robust validation pipeline  so you can use the reagents off the  shelf without having to spend months or  even years to validate that content  if there's an antibody of interest to  your research that you've used in the  past and you want to add in here you can  also do that  i mentioned you can add up to 10  different custom antibodies  you can do 10 from nanostring or five  total from abcam  appcam has greater than 6000 antibodies  for custom conjugation to pick from  so you can make our match our protein  core  and our modules with that additional  custom content to meet whatever your  spatial profiling needs are our custom  content goes through  um a different set of validation it  doesn't get fully validated as i just  laid out  but if ordered through ad cam it does go  through a pre and post conjugation  screen so that you can be  assured that it will work in ihc so i'd  like to leave you with that now  knowing that we have over 200 different  antibodies that are fully validated  and we're happy to talk with you more  about the geomix digital 