ncy across those panels  and then we will also be adding our  mouse neuroscience panels  will protein content be available for  ngs readout  yes protein content is in our plan to  make for ngs readout  currently it's only available for end  counter readout which is why you're  limited to the 96 plex currently  but we do have plans to release protein  for ngs  and that will allow that plex to  increase as well  are there any concerns that the index in  oligo interferes with the antibody  binding  that's another great question the main  one of the primary reasons we do our pre  and post  conjugation ihc is to ensure there  hasn't  that in this indexing oligo or that that  barcode that we use  has not inferior interfered with how the  antibody binds so we look to ensure that  we have similar patterns  um in those ihc stains both pre  and post conjugation

